  * power arrives; meanwhile nothing reaches the device over the network.
  * Not while a voice note recorded offline waits to go (for a while). Returns
  * true while napping.
+ *
+ * "Stay online" (settings, Sleep page) turns the automatic part of this off:
+ * whatever is supposed to reach the screen then finds it at the network,
+ * without anyone touching the screen first. The association is all it gives up
+ * either way - resting already puts the radio in its deepest modem sleep
